                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">YOUR ELEVEN TOOLS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The full mindset toolkit</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"150\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L1: Two Mindsets</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Fixed vs. growth</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">The core distinction</text><rect x=\"410\" y=\"150\" width=\"280\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L2: Origins</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Where mindsets</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">come from</text><rect x=\"710\" y=\"150\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L3: The Power of Yet</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">\"I can't\" becomes</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">\"I can't yet\"</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"340\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L4: Praise Trap</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Effort over talent</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Process, not product</text><rect x=\"410\" y=\"340\" width=\"280\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L5: Sports</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Champions are</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">made, not born</text><rect x=\"710\" y=\"340\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L6: Work</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">CEOs, teams,</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">culture, learning</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"530\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L7: Relationships</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Love is built,</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">not found</text><rect x=\"410\" y=\"530\" width=\"280\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L8: Parents</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Praise the</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">process</text><rect x=\"710\" y=\"530\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L9: Failure</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Information,</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">not verdict</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"720\" width=\"500\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L10: False Growth Mindset</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">The trap of fake versions</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Effort without strategy isn't growth</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"720\" width=\"480\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">L11: The 4 Steps</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Hear, name, respond, act</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">The change protocol</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"920\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">Eleven tools. One job: use them daily.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1015\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">A tool you don't use is just a paragraph you remember</text></svg>",
