                {
                  "type": "quiz",
                  "question": "According to Csikszentmihalyi, why is filling every gap with TikTok or YouTube one of the 'three cognitive flow sins'?",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "text": "It uses up your daily allotment of dopamine, leaving none for work",
                      "correct": false
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "It resets your 'interesting' baseline upward, making slower cognitive work feel unbearable",
                      "correct": true
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "It directly damages working memory in measurable ways within 24 hours",
                      "correct": false
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "It teaches your brain that all entertainment must be passive",
                      "correct": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "explanation": "Easy entertainment in down time **resets your 'interesting' baseline upward.** After hours of high-stimulation algorithmic content, a book or a math problem feels unbearably slow by comparison — even though it isn't. Boredom isn't the enemy of flow; it's the soil flow grows in. Defending your boredom — letting yourself be unstimulated in line at the store, on the walk, in the car — is what preserves your capacity to find slow cognitive work interesting.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The baseline problem</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE MECHANISM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">High-stimulation content raises</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">your \"interesting\" baseline.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Slow work then feels unbearable.</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"440\" width=\"500\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">FED BASELINE</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Books feel slow.</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Problems feel boring.</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Flow never enters</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"440\" width=\"480\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">STARVED BASELINE</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Books feel rich.</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Problems feel alive.</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Flow enters easily</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">DEFEND YOUR BOREDOM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Boredom is not the enemy of flow.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">It is the soil flow grows in.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Defend your boredom — it is the soil of flow"
                  }
                }
