                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The Brickman and Coates lottery study</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"190\" width=\"1000\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE 1978 STUDY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Three groups, one year after the event:</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Lottery winners (won $50K–$1M)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Regular controls (no event)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Paralyzed accident victims</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">All three groups converged toward baseline.</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"610\" width=\"1000\" height=\"370\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WHAT TO REMEMBER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">The biggest event of someone's life</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"765\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">does NOT permanently move the dial</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">on their general happiness.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Humans return to themselves.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">This is the foundational finding behind</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">decades of happiness research that followed.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The convergence is the central finding"
