                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Sacks on Hildegard</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"220\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">MECHANISM + MEANING</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">explaining 'how' need not explain away</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">migraine aura as a doorway, not a debunking</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"470\" width=\"600\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">What is his key principle?</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The integration of brain and spirit"
